{"4272790": {"success": true, "data": {"type": "game", "name": "Approach Control: Remastered", "steam_appid": 4272790, "required_age": 0, "is_free": false, "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Approach Control: Remastered</strong> is a professional-grade air traffic control simulation designed by real-world air traffic controllers.  Our new voice recognition feature and pilot voices recorded from real-world air traffic controllers make this simulation feel authentic.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4272790/extras/95563ec88552f40f545c9d789505d90a.avif?t=1769142732\" data-big-src=https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4272790/extras_big/95563ec88552f40f545c9d789505d90a.avif?t=1769142732 width=1560 height=720 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You’ll work real approach radar, manage high-density arrival flows, and issue clearances using authentic procedures. The radar behaves like real approach control radar, including a true 3-second sweep used by professional controllers, along with real ICAO separation and wake turbulence standards. This is not an arcade game, but a hardcore aviation experience.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Aircraft must be spaced correctly, assigned proper altitudes and headings, and sequenced safely to the runway. As traffic increases, the pressure builds, just like it does in a real approach control room.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4272790/extras/15c9941f365fcef0c5d3810c82bd2300.avif?t=1769142732\" data-big-src=https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4272790/extras_big/15c9941f365fcef0c5d3810c82bd2300.avif?t=1769142732 width=1560 height=720 /></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Key Features</h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Authentic ATC radar simulation</strong> with real-world behavior</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Voice Recognition</strong></p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>True 3-second radar sweep</strong> for realistic situational awareness</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Real ICAO separation and wake turbulence rules</strong></p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Multiple approach sectors</strong> with unique runway layouts and arrival flows</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Designed by real air traffic controllers</strong> for realism and accuracy</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4272790/extras/77953c3787cc49e57cb5f28753778f81.avif?t=1769142732\" data-big-src=https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4272790/extras_big/77953c3787cc49e57cb5f28753778f81.avif?t=1769142732 width=1560 height=720 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Approach Control: Remastered delivers a focused, realistic simulation experience that rewards precision, planning, and calm decision-making under pressure.</p>", "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Approach Control: Remastered</strong> is a professional-grade air traffic control simulation designed by real-world air traffic controllers.  Our new voice recognition feature and pilot voices recorded from real-world air traffic controllers make this simulation feel authentic.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4272790/extras/95563ec88552f40f545c9d789505d90a.avif?t=1769142732\" data-big-src=https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4272790/extras_big/95563ec88552f40f545c9d789505d90a.avif?t=1769142732 width=1560 height=720 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You’ll work real approach radar, manage high-density arrival flows, and issue clearances using authentic procedures. The radar behaves like real approach control radar, including a true 3-second sweep used by professional controllers, along with real ICAO separation and wake turbulence standards. This is not an arcade game, but a hardcore aviation experience.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Aircraft must be spaced correctly, assigned proper altitudes and headings, and sequenced safely to the runway. As traffic increases, the pressure builds, just like it does in a real approach control room.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4272790/extras/15c9941f365fcef0c5d3810c82bd2300.avif?t=1769142732\" data-big-src=https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4272790/extras_big/15c9941f365fcef0c5d3810c82bd2300.avif?t=1769142732 width=1560 height=720 /></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Key Features</h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Authentic ATC radar simulation</strong> with real-world behavior</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Voice Recognition</strong></p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>True 3-second radar sweep</strong> for realistic situational awareness</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Real ICAO separation and wake turbulence rules</strong></p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Multiple approach sectors</strong> with unique runway layouts and arrival flows</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Designed by real air traffic controllers</strong> for realism and accuracy</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https